    "descriptionZh": "把图片处理成电子墨水屏能显示的样子：S 曲线色调映射、四种误差扩散抖动、再压到屏幕真实亮度范围，CLI 与 Node 库都能调。",
    "takeawayZh": "把图片转成墨水屏能显示的抖动图",
    "noteZh": "README 抬头 epaper-image-convert，副标题 Convert images for e-paper displays with advanced tone mapping, dithering, and color palette optimization.；Features 一段列 Advanced Tone Mapping、Error Diffusion Dithering（Floyd-Steinberg / Stucki / Burkes / Sierra）、Dynamic Range Compression、Color Palette Support、EXIF Orientation。CLI Usage 给的例子是 epaper-image-convert input.jpg -d 640x384 和 epaper-image-convert ./photos ./converted，Processing Presets 一节有三档 preset：balanced（默认）、dynamic、vivid。右栏 About 写 Advance epaper image conversion library and CLI，许可 MIT，20 Tags，还挂一条 Sponsor this project 指向 buymeacoffee.com/aitjcize。",
